{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>教宗良十四世日前接受治療肺癌手術，醫生稱根據病理學檢查結果，他毋須再接受治療。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.VAT.POPE-0630_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026dzPTp563Bb1792627739.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>梵蒂岡傳媒指，兩名醫生通報，有關良十四世的健康狀況，指他上周二接受手術期間，醫生取得標本，經過組織病理學分析後，再度確認良十四世患有肺腺癌，但癌細胞未有擴散，醫生根據後續腫瘤評估，確認他毋須接受進一步治療。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T00:41:03.203881+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T01:57:55.418970+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T00:37:45.084643+00:00","content_hash":"d58487e333ed037ee66959c5a10de19ea2204a42cea40e333e4a52a068a49d91","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}